Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静  弹簧狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Settle down, Slink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下  乖狗狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit. Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长  我需要担心吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff, do I need to be worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用  我的伙计们身经百战  他们可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. My guys are veterans. They'll hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  在收到消息前  让他们保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Just keep them calm until we get word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:08:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天感觉怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you, uh, feeling about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好  挺好  挺好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, good. Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我挺好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家准备  邦妮吃完早饭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on! Bonnie's done with breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 随时都会进来  - 你们听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any minute now. - You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时都会进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打起精神  上好发条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wind 'em if you got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清理好你们的电池  活动开你们的关节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your batteries clean, your joints unlocked...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  胡迪  交给我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Woody. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  对不起  你说得对  你说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm sorry. You're right, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小镇开张啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The town is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  镇长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银行家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  冰淇淋摊主  你好  帽子店老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Ice-Cream Man! Hi, Hat Shop Owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.33,0:08:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邮递员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mailman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  玩具们再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Bye, toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾  红心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giddy-up, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.35,0:08:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们朝那边去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They went that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chase them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多漂亮的帽子店啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a beautiful hat shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有这么多帽子  - 他们在玩"帽子店"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have so many hats... - Wow. They're doing "Hat Shop."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上次玩这个是什么时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the last time we ever got to play that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得她玩"过家家"的时候吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when she played "House"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢"过家家"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I liked "House."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前的好日子啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were the days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was basic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建一个家  在里面过日子  成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a house, you lived in it, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你这周第三次没被选中了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the third time you haven't been picked this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  我没有在算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't keep count.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来帮你算  - 好  好  我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll do it for you. - Okay, okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是有一阵了  - 瞧瞧看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been a while. - Oh, looky there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有了第一个灰尘团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got your first dust bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要给它起什么名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you gonna name it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫尘尘怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Dusty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 弗朗西斯  - 哈里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Francis! - Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯伦  - 毛球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Karen! - Fuzzball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 勒布朗  - 不  毛茸茸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- LeBron. - No, Fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 桑普兔怎么样  - 风滚草{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about Thumper? - Tumbleweed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"风滚草"  这个好  这个好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Tumbleweed." Oh, that's good. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个牛仔  因此这个名字很合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a cowboy, so that makes a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选择太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么  我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想幼儿园迎新会迟到吧  对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna be late for kindergarten orientation, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:42.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但...我不想去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... I don't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们聊过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去见你的老师们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna meet your teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看你的教室  - 我能带玩具去吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- see your classroom... - Can I bring a toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具不能带去上学  这是规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toys don't go to school, that's the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动  大家不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze! Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮总是会忘带什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie always forgets something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她随时都会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be back any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不许动  火腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That goes for you, too, Hamm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是钱啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's money!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧  胡迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right, Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次她一定会选你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure she'll pick you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  我没事  没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, I'm fine. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪  给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  杰西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们支持你  伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here for you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不想演面包师  - 刺毛裤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to play the baker. - Pricklepants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我天生就该演帽子店老板  - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The hat shop owner is the role I was born to play! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  刺毛裤  回你的面包房吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Pricklepants, back to your bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  桃莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Dolly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪  你没看见我正在恐吓大伙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody, can't you see I'm threatening everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回壁橱里去  - 我知道  只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go back to the closet. - Yeah, I know. I know. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm worried about Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该有个玩具陪她去迎新会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A toy should go with her to orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没听到爸爸说的吗  你会害邦妮惹麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you hear Dad? You'll get Bonnie in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  但幼儿园很不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but kindergarten is so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩可能觉得吃不消{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be too much for a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能有个伙伴陪着渡过难关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having a buddy with them to get through it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会很有帮助的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can really help things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得以前我就会和安迪一起去上学...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember with Andy, I would go to school with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  胡迪  我也不想像复读机一样唠叨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Woody. I hate to sound like a broken record.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但邦妮不是安迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Bonnie is not Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对对  当然了  我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, of course, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但如果你能...  - 大家就位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But if you would just... - Places, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你躲在这里做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  我们必须走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是我的乖女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my big girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  我们得赶紧了  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We got to hurry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了你的书包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会很好玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  你说到哪了  胡迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Now what was it you were saying, Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎参加迎新会)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮  亲爱的  没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie, honey, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  你是邦妮吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi! Are you Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.03,0:11:52.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是温迪老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Miss Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后我就是你的幼儿园老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to be your kindergarten teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有个特别的地方给你放书包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a special place where you can put your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想看看吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.81,0:12:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里  邦妮  你专用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are, Bonnie. Just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  同学们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, class,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在桌子旁边找个位子坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's all find a seat at a table...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就要开始手工时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can start craft time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上学的第一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the first day of school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都需要有个地方来放铅笔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll need a place to put your pencils.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以今天  我们就来做笔筒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, today, we're going to make pencil holders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.49,0:12:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  每个人拿出一个杯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, everyone take a cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们用美术用品来装饰它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll use the art supplies to decorate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(邦妮)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮  真有创意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie. That is so clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你好  我叫叉叉  很高兴认识你"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hello, I'm Forky. Nice to meet you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  叉叉  很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hello, Forky, it's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是温迪老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Miss Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  爸爸  看看我做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad! Look what I made!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Forky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:27.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上完幼儿园了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finished kindergarten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  今天只是迎新会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That was just orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你这么勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for being such a brave girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要给你个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.53,0:14:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然还有一周才开学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since school doesn't start for another week,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就来个自驾游{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are going on a road trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能带叉叉去吗  - 当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I bring Forky? - 'Course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还说我不该跟邦妮去学校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they said I shouldn't go to school with Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幼儿园的情况尽在我们掌控之中  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got this kindergarten thing under control, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不敢相信我居然在跟叉勺说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I'm talking to a spork.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具们好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具们再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他果然去幼儿园了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did go to kindergarten!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我就知道  - 不不不  各位  听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I knew it. - No, no, no, guys, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:18.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要给邦妮惹麻烦吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tryin' to get Bonnie in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  当然不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能会被没收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have been confiscated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么意思  - 被带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What does that mean - Taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  - 还有更吓人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能会被弄丢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've been lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  各位  听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, guys, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮在幼儿园度过了快乐的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie had a great day in class...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们还要去自驾游{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're going on a road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 自驾游  - 度假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Road trip - Vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后发生了一件怪事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then something really weird happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮在课堂上做了个朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie made a friend in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这孩子真不错  - 她已经交上朋友了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What a kid. - Oh, she's already making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  她真的"做"了个新朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. She literally made a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.47,0:15:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来吧  就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on out. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  出来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我拉你出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's get you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.15,0:15:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  认识一下叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, I want you to meet Forky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的老天爷  - 快看啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Golly Bob howdy! - Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的胳膊可真长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how long his arms are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.53,0:16:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 垃圾  - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Trash? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩...玩...垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T-Toy... Trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.05,0:16:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不不  没事的  - 垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no, it's okay. - Trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪  我有个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上  不止一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, actually, not just one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我满脑子都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满脑子都是问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have all the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么要去垃圾桶那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he want to go to the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 因为他是用垃圾做的  - 垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because he was made from trash. - Trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我知道这有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know this is a little strange, but
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但你们要相信我  - 垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you got to trust me on this. - Trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉现在是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky is the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮心目中最重要的玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}most important toy to Bonnie right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Important?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个叉勺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a spork.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  没错  我知道  但这个叉勺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yeah, I know, but this spork...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个玩具是邦妮适应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this toy is crucial to Bonnie
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幼儿园生活的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}getting adjusted to kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪  你这样是不是太小题大做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody, aren't you being a little dramatic about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道大家有点不适应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this is new to everybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们应该明白这个小家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you should see how much
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于邦妮来说意义非凡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this little guy means to Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当她开始跟他玩时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she started playing with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她脸上的笑容是有史以来最灿烂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she had the biggest smile on her face.
