Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.13,0:29:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  我认识宝贝  - 你认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yes, I know Bo. - You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.55,0:29:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐进来  我们带你们去见她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hop on in. We'll take you to her.
