Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.97,0:39:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个玩具都为此心碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it broke every toy's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.55,0:39:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后  宝贝来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, Bo came into the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有她的台灯能让莫莉感到安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her lamp was the only thing that made Molly feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:40:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈会让她整晚开着宝贝的灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom would let her keep Bo on all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.56,0:40:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁猜得出你曾经那么温柔呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha! Who knew you were such a softy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.73,0:40:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫莉会握着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Molly would fall asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.98,0:40:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝的脚入睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with her hand resting on Bo's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  好了  我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! Okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.11,0:40:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  我的孩子真的很需要这个玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bo, my kid really needs this toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.41,0:40:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看在旧情的份上帮帮我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you help me? For old times' sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.62,0:40:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.42,0:40:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you! - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.63,0:40:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们要行动了  开车吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess we're doing this. Let's ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二机会古董店  出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second Chance Antiques, and step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(第二机会古董店)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.66,0:40:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本森  完事没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benson, are we finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.24,0:40:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.78,0:40:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧看  完好如新{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that! Good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.45,0:41:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  谢谢你  本森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Thank you, uh, Benson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.04,0:41:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  胡迪什么时候回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, um, when's Woody coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.33,0:41:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如我所说  很快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会忘了你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.55,0:41:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.42,0:41:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你孩子的名字就在你脚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have your child's name written on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.47,0:41:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木棍脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.59,0:41:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你是一个非常重要的玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes you a very important toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.89,0:41:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪也是这样说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what Woody says.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.43,0:41:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.43,0:41:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外婆  我们回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Grandma! We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.93,0:41:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.35,0:41:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.35,0:41:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈莫妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.61,0:41:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  她把胡迪带走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second... she took Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她把胡迪弄丢了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she lose him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.44,0:41:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  我的哈莫妮是完美的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. My Harmony is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.20,0:41:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉  下午茶时间到了  下午茶时间到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky, it's tea time. It's tea time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.54,0:41:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午茶时间是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is tea time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.83,0:41:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我展示给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.87,0:41:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(嘉比嘉比  我们做朋友吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.21,0:41:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加一点点牛奶  两块糖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little bit of milk, two lumps of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.17,0:41:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在练习  我看上去怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been practicing. How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.22,0:41:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抬高点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.35,0:42:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸出你的小拇指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick out your pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.35,0:42:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.64,0:42:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美味极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.73,0:42:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈莫妮  亲爱的  我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harmony, sweetie, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.65,0:42:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来给我一个拥抱吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come give me a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.90,0:42:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  妈妈  我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Mom. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.08,0:42:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我的声匣修好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my voice box is fixed...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.54,0:42:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就终于有机会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll finally get my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.35,0:42:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  关于我们的朋友胡迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, about our friend Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.89,0:42:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道关于他的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know everything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.69,0:42:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  胡迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.64,0:42:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子的朋友  也就是两天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've known that guy my whole life. Two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.94,0:42:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道邦妮不是他的第一个孩子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, did you know that Bonnie was not his first kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.19,0:42:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾有另外一个孩子  安迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had this other kid, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.44,0:42:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.08,0:43:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.54,0:43:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往上看  铁臂阿童木{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, up here, Astro-boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.09,0:43:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你自以为可以大摇大摆出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think you can just show up
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.75,0:43:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,占据我们的最佳奖品位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and take our top prize spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.71,0:43:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你就错了  - 大错特错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you're wrong! - Dead wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.76,0:43:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不明白  我想要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. I'm trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.59,0:43:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钻空子找个孩子  我们早就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheat the system and get with a kid. Yeah, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.84,0:43:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  我需要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.26,0:43:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个孩子给予你无条件的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A child to shower you with unconditional love?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.52,0:43:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都一样  伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join the club, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.93,0:43:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  大家都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, join the club!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.64,0:43:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  帮我逃离这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, help me get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.23,0:43:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你  用我的脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help you. With my foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.56,0:43:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踹他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踹他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.44,0:43:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小兔  你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunny, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.73,0:43:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我够不到他  帮帮我  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't reach him. Help me out here, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.94,0:43:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  小鸭  我可不会读心术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Ducky. I'm not a mind reader, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.32,0:43:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么不明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's not to understand, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.12,0:43:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非得要我说出来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna make me say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.16,0:43:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.83,0:43:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这小短腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With these tiny legs,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.79,0:43:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有你的帮助我够不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot reach without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.83,0:43:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  这就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay This is what
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.50,0:43:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想告诉你的  小兔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been talking about, Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.54,0:43:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得学会集中注意力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to work on paying attention
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.87,0:43:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倾听别人说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your listening skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.46,0:43:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你觉得如何  骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you like that, cheater?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.09,0:43:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.34,0:44:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙  吃我一脚  看招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To infinity and my foot! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.55,0:44:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一个遥远的星系  你的头被踢了一脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a galaxy far, far away, you got kicked in the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.39,0:44:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么才能脱困{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.47,0:44:06.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球有毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet is toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.72,0:44:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上头盔保存氧气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closing helmet to conserve oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.73,0:44:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在真空环境中  他们听不到你的尖叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the vacuum of space, they cannot hear you scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.35,0:44:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.11,0:44:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.15,0:44:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来重力是这样的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, that's what gravity feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.19,0:44:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  就是重力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.40,0:44:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.65,0:44:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空人  你最好给我回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get over here, spaceman!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.99,0:44:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  把我们放回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, put us back up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.62,0:44:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小兔  你在干什么  他要跑了  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunny, what are you doing? He's getting away, let's go!
