Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.67,0:48:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 叉叉在哪  - 说来话长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Forky? - Long story.
