Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.42,0:48:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ∮ 孩子  我们有孩子了 ∮  - ∮ 孩子  孩子 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ∮ Kid, we get a kid ∮ - ∮ Kid, kid, kid ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.13,0:48:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我们有孩子了 ∮  - ∮ 我们有孩子了  孩子 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ∮ We gonna kid? ∮ - ∮ We gonna kid, kid... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.59,0:48:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都找不到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.97,0:48:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.76,0:48:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  真抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.47,0:48:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  咱们到外面再找一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Let's look outside one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.85,0:48:21.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是之后我们就要继续赶路了  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then we have to keep driving, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.73,0:48:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要离开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're about to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要走了  - 他们不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leaving? - They can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.90,0:48:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恐慌症发作了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The panic is attacking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.24,0:48:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小心点  哥们  - 我们该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch it, buddy! - What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.95,0:48:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们要阻止他们  - 怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to stop them! - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.41,0:48:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以陷害爸爸让他坐牢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could frame Dad for a crime so he goes to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.08,0:48:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者回到过去  警告胡迪未来发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or go back in time and warn Woody about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.41,0:48:40.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太疯狂了  时间是个扁平的循环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's crazy. Time is a flat circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.29,0:48:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.00,0:48:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.38,0:48:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们四处都找遍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.25,0:48:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们现在要出发了  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need to get going now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.80,0:48:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以给叉叉留个字条吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we please leave a note for Forky...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.26,0:48:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样他就知道我们要去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he knows where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他必须去上幼儿园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has to go to kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:48:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑  我简直...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me, I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.85,0:49:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都很顺利...我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is going perfect... I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.85,0:49:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  爸爸需要飚几句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! Daddy's going to use some words.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.86,0:49:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如我们去嘉年华玩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about we go to the carnival?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.52,0:49:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者在镇子上的商店里转转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe check out some of those shops in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.78,0:49:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.57,0:49:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们哪都去不了了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.36,0:49:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们懂我的意思（意思是“尖”）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.53,0:49:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了  - 天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brilliant! - That was genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.99,0:49:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  杰西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work, Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.08,0:49:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴斯和胡迪一定已经在回来的路上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Buzz and Woody are on their way back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.25,0:49:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉在那里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky is in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:26.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.59,0:49:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  我有个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, hold on. I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.09,0:49:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮会更喜欢谁  小鸭还是我  说我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who will Bonnie love more? Ducky or me. Say me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.96,0:49:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  说小鸭  小鸭  - 小兔  小兔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, say Ducky. Ducky. - Bunny. Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.38,0:49:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了伙计们  胡闹的时间结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys. Playtime is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.68,0:49:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都要听我指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.22,0:49:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们待在一起  保持安静  听懂了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stay together, we stay quiet. Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.18,0:49:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了  带路吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.83,0:50:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 逗我呢吧  - 过去点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you kidding me. - Move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你过去点  - 别推我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You move over. - Quit pushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.37,0:50:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.46,0:50:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的老天  这只羊有三个头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my maker! That sheep has three heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.01,0:50:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.63,0:50:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这六只小眼睛看穿了我的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What all six eyes just looked into my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.30,0:50:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做噩梦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna have nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.48,0:50:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的叉叉应该就是被关在那里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's most likely where your Forky is being kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.90,0:50:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  还不算太糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, this isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.15,0:50:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要避免被那些假人看到就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just can't be seen by the dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.19,0:50:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不光是那些假人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just the dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.57,0:50:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的橱柜被毫无遮拦的过道环绕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her cabinet is surrounded by a moat of exposed aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.28,0:50:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有恶龙出没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where Dragon roams.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.41,0:50:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 猫我们能应付  - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can handle a cat. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.87,0:50:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.08,0:50:41.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的体内就是那样的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that how we look on the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.88,0:50:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多...绒毛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so much... fluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.92,0:50:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你觉得我们应该怎么过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how do you propose we get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.42,0:50:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以直接穿过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could go straight across.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.72,0:50:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么做  - 这要跳好远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How. - That's quite a jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.47,0:50:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认识最合适的玩具帮手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know the perfect toy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.89,0:50:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮  快来看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.85,0:50:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看看这些好玩的东西  - 邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at all this cool stuff. - Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.22,0:50:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要立刻找到叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get Forky now!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.52,0:50:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪  别...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody, don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.85,0:50:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 按计划执行  - 收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stick to the plan. - 10-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.23,0:51:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟我来  - 收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Follow me. - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.28,0:51:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪只能待在壁橱里  没机会玩耍吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody just sits in the closet? With no playtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  他自己告诉我的  他没用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he told me himself, he's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.24,0:51:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.28,0:51:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头发真好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such pretty hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.53,0:51:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.79,0:51:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得按计划行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.87,0:51:18.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那可是邦妮  她就在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's Bonnie. She's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.62,0:51:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能接着去嘉年华吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go to the carnival, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.46,0:51:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.12,0:51:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  不要出声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.71,0:51:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好祈祷那些假人没有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better hope the dummies didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.88,0:52:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的羊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.38,0:52:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么说得来着  我带路  你跟着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I say? I lead. You follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.64,0:52:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  我十分抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bo, I'm so sorry. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.35,0:52:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快告诉我该怎么帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me how to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.47,0:52:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的想要帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really wanna help?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.31,0:52:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别挡着我的路  我要把羊找回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then stay out of my way. I'm getting my sheep back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.27,0:52:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那其他人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.18,0:52:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑笑知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giggle knows what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.15,0:52:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看  - 那就是我们的目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go. - That's our objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.15,0:52:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须拿到那把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.69,0:52:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是进入橱柜唯一的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way inside the cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.53,0:52:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.99,0:52:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么可能做得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.70,0:52:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.57,0:52:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  交给我们吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, leave that to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.03,0:52:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很清楚该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know exactly what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.54,0:52:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个是从哪来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you two come from?
