Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.53,1:07:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  该起飞了  离开  后退  跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Time to fly! Exit the... Back... Run...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.91,1:07:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去  返回星际总部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Returning to Star Command.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.66,1:07:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.04,1:07:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢  内心的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, inner voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.67,1:07:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈莫妮  亲爱的  帮外婆关门打烊吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harmony, honey, help Grandma close up for the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.38,1:07:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  然后我们能去嘉年华吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Then can we go to the carnival?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.51,1:07:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.27,1:07:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  胡迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.60,1:07:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.11,1:07:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不了解我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.69,1:07:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确实了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.65,1:07:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被留在壁橱里  感觉自己毫无用处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were left in the closet, feeling useless...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.40,1:07:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀疑自己还会不会被孩子玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wondering if you'll ever get played with.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.37,1:07:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有叉叉我是不会走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving without Forky.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.49,1:07:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能就在一件事上达成共识吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we agree on just one thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.33,1:07:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.00,1:08:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪伴一个孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That being there for a child
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.12,1:08:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是玩具能做的最高尚的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the most noble thing a toy can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.17,1:08:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.51,1:08:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一拆封就有缺陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was defective right out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.18,1:08:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能想象你这样是什么感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only imagine what it must have been like for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.68,1:08:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你陪伴安迪那么长时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that time you spent with Andy...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.14,1:08:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次和他一起骑自行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}riding a bike with him for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.36,1:08:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他膝盖擦伤时安慰他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comforting him when he skinned his knee...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.90,1:08:31.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骄傲地看他长大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}proudly watching him grow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.20,1:08:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你又和邦妮有了第二次机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you got a second chance with Bonnie...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.28,1:08:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当她在学校害怕时给她安慰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving her comfort when she's scared at school...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.41,1:08:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她最需要的时候帮助她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}helping her when she needs it most.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.87,1:08:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的悲喜你一直陪伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been there through all their ups and downs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.50,1:08:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.05,1:08:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.38,1:08:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的像听起来那么棒吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it as wonderful as it sounds?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.97,1:08:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.81,1:09:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要的只是其中一个片段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is a chance for just one of those moments.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.23,1:09:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意付出一切  只求像你那样被爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd give anything to be loved the way you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把叉叉给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave me Forky.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.29,1:09:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮需要他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonnie needs him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.58,1:09:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.45,1:09:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(大盆地)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.06,1:09:42.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆胎修好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The flat tire is fixed!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.02,1:09:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊  胡迪  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Woody, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.35,1:09:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.65,1:09:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 巴斯  - 巴斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buzz! - Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.52,1:09:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 胡迪在哪  - 还有叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Woody? - And Forky?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.94,1:09:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.90,1:09:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要帮他们从古董店撤离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to be extracted from the antique store.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.90,1:09:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.15,1:09:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  确保我们没落下什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's make sure we have everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.57,1:09:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.86,1:09:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.66,1:10:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦妮随时会发现她的背包不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any minute now... Bonnie will notice her backpack is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.70,1:10:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会意识到她把背包落在了古董店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll realize she left it at the antique store...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.83,1:10:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们就会回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll head back in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.83,1:10:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  看起来没忘什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Looks like we have everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.46,1:10:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的东西都在吗  邦妮  - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You good, Bonnie? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.17,1:10:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.75,1:10:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  天才  现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, genius, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.80,1:10:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜查周边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.92,1:10:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大强度激光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laser at full power!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.84,1:10:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 巴斯  你在干什么  - 我在思考{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buzz, what are you doing? - I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.18,1:10:20.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  你能把那个玩具的声音关掉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, will you please shut that toy off?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.97,1:10:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我来弄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.06,1:10:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击  流星雨  小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack! Meteor shower! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.06,1:10:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在未知领域执行的秘密任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a secret mission in uncharted space!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.89,1:10:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.77,1:10:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴斯光年前来救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.31,1:10:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 邦妮  怎么把这个关掉  - 全速向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bonnie, how do you turn this off? - Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.56,1:10:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 打开分离舱门  - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open the pod bay doors! - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.19,1:10:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩你和我了  学员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just you and me now, cadet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.24,1:10:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个火箭发射了求救信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A distress signal is coming from that rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.28,1:10:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扔进柜子就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just toss it in the drawer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.07,1:10:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙  浩瀚无垠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.74,1:10:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的背包在古董店  出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your backpack's in the antique store! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.87,1:10:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好  我的背包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, my backpack!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.87,1:10:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把背包落在古董店了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left my backpack in the antique store!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.79,1:10:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.42,1:10:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我们绕道去拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's swing by and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.22,1:11:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个牛仔居然这么不要脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe the nerve of that cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.64,1:11:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以为他是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, who does he think he is?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.64,1:11:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.43,1:11:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他太过分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was way out of line.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.27,1:11:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你扔下他是正确的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did the right thing leaving him behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.64,1:11:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羊排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lamb Chops?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.10,1:11:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.40,1:11:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往中心走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head to the middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.28,1:11:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等明天嘉年华离开的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the carnival leaves tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.57,1:11:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就藏在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll hide right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.74,1:11:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没门  - 拒绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way! - Stuff that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.99,1:11:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.66,1:11:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟紧我  你们会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick with me. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.16,1:11:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗  - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.95,1:11:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没说完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And another thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.87,1:11:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 胡迪请求你的帮助  - 各就各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Woody asked you for help. - On your mark...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.75,1:11:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就那样对待你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he treats you like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.96,1:11:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 预备  - 他只关心自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get set... - He only cares about himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.29,1:11:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.46,1:11:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.21,1:11:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪总是努力做对孩子有利的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody's always trying to do right by his kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.38,1:11:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把其他人都置于危险中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By putting everyone in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种疯狂的忠诚真是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kind of crazy loyalty just...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.59,1:11:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人不得不爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to love him for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.60,1:11:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say what now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.64,1:11:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  计划是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bo! What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.06,1:11:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fill me in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.90,1:11:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上来  我们要回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in! We're going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.36,1:11:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才刚到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.40,1:11:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听到宝贝的话了  我们要回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard Bo! We're going back!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.24,1:12:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绒毛快进来  开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your plush! Let's ride!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.16,1:12:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我最爱的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my favorite...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.64,1:12:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.43,1:12:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.97,1:12:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们玩一整天吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's play all day!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.72,1:12:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本森  你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benson! Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.48,1:12:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是很可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that lovely?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.98,1:12:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午茶时间到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.23,1:12:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  胡迪  谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Woody. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.61,1:12:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了你  我的梦想都要实现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my dreams are coming true because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.78,1:12:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.07,1:12:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.70,1:12:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候了  本森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time, Benson.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.95,1:12:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  叉叉  我会想念和你聊天的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Forky. I'm going to miss our talks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.70,1:12:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是  祝你好运  嘉比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too. Good luck, Gabby.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.37,1:12:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  我的小餐具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, my little utensil.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.46,1:12:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  嘉比  再见  本森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Gabby! Goodbye, Benson!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.92,1:12:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.63,1:13:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.34,1:13:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 邦妮  - 有什么需要帮助的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bonnie? - Can I help you with anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.84,1:13:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我们刚刚打过电话问背包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We called about the backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.68,1:13:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我没找到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.22,1:13:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以自己找找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel free to look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.10,1:13:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  在她发现前进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Before she finds it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.14,1:13:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧  哈莫妮在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! There's Harmony.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.07,1:13:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我如此开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make me so happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.03,1:13:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做最好的朋友吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.32,1:13:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.82,1:13:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要回家了  叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going home, Forky!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.24,1:13:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.74,1:13:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  胡迪  瞧  真的发生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Woody, look! It's really happening!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.67,1:13:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是嘉比嘉比  我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Gabby Gabby, and I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.18,1:13:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要哭出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发现了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you got there?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.02,1:13:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现了这个旧娃娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this old doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.85,1:13:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想要可以带回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take it home if you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.81,1:13:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.53,1:14:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事  嘉比本该是她的玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? Gabby was supposed to be her toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.28,1:14:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的背包在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's my backpack!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.99,1:14:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  在这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, it's over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.37,1:14:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.63,1:14:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  我找到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I found him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.46,1:14:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这里啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.00,1:14:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把他放进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, please leave him in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.42,1:14:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免得再弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he doesn't get lost again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.10,1:14:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是嘉比怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about Gabby?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.27,1:14:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叉叉  仔细听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forky, listen to me very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.94,1:14:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这很重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.10,1:14:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉巴斯把房车带到旋转木马那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Buzz to get the RV to the merry-go-round.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.98,1:14:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.77,1:14:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白  旋转木马是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. What is a merry-go-round?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.61,1:14:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个有灯有马的旋转圆盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spinny ride with lights and horses.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.15,1:14:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说旋转木马啊  - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean a carousel. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.03,1:14:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旋转木马  没错  在旋转木马那里等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carousel. Yes! Meet me at the carousel.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.95,1:14:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.50,1:15:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(抱歉  我们打烊了)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.09,1:15:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘉比  嘉比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabby! Gabby!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.48,1:15:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以把声匣拿回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have your voice box back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.36,1:15:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.21,1:15:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.36,1:15:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈莫妮不是你的唯一机会  嘉比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harmony wasn't your only chance, Gabby,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.29,1:15:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们必须抓紧时间  快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we have to hurry. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.61,1:15:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  哈莫妮就是我的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Harmony was my chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.88,1:15:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的时间结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My time's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.96,1:15:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, please go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.96,1:15:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.70,1:15:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个朋友曾告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend once told me...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.89,1:15:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"这世上有那么多孩子"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There are plenty of kids out there."
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.41,1:15:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一个叫邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one of them is named Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.79,1:16:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在正在等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's waiting for you, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.71,1:16:03.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是她还不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just doesn't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.84,1:16:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一你错了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you're wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.46,1:16:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你下半生都待在架子上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you sit on a shelf the rest of your life...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.06,1:16:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远也不会知道  不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll never find out, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.77,1:16:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最厉害的玩具教给我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I learned that from the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.00,1:16:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  嘉比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Gabby.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.29,1:16:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们带你去找邦妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you to Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.77,1:16:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旋转木马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The carousel?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.60,1:16:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  就是那个有灯有马的旋转圆盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's the spinny ride with lights and horses.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.43,1:16:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡迪说在那里等他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woody said to meet him there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.30,1:16:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你肯定是在开玩笑  - 我们怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got to be kidding! - How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.10,1:16:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.01,1:16:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能把爸爸送去坐牢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not sending Dad to jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.62,1:16:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真没劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.83,1:16:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八百米后左转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left turn in 0.5 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.91,1:16:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second. I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.86,1:17:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭鼬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skunk!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.93,1:17:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人太多了  需要换一条路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many people. Gonna need an alternate route.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.14,1:17:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能及时赶到旋转木马吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will we make it to the carousel in time?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.13,1:17:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能行  加拿大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we Canada!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.30,1:17:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.66,1:17:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新规划路线  右转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recalculating. Take a right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.95,1:17:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  右转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? A right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.35,1:17:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前方右转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right turn ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.50,1:17:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GPS听起来是不是有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does the GPS sound funny to you?
